      "extract": "2020 Mathematics Subject Classiﬁcation: Primary - 20C08, 57K14, 57K18 Abstract We give a simple construction of Markov traces for Iwahori–Hecke algebras associated with the crystallographic Coxeter groups of types An, Bn and Dn. In types B and D, it is new and generalises a known construction in type A employing symmetric polynomials in multiplicative Jucys–Murphy elements.",
      "extractCut": false
